[152.453612, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[152.556984, "o", "=== the chat template of gemma3:1b (from Ollama, unchanged) ===\r\n{{- range $i, $_ := .Messages }}\r\n{{- $last := eq (len (slice $.Messages $i)) 1 }}\r\n{{- if or (eq .Role \"user\") (eq .Role \"system\") }}<start_of_turn>user\r\n{{ .Content }}<end_of_turn>\r\n{{ if $last }}<start_of_turn>model\r\n{{ end }}\r\n{{- else if eq .Role \"assistant\" }}<start_of_turn>model\r\n{{ .Content }}{{ if not $last }}<end_of_turn>\r\n{{ end }}\r\n{{- end }}\r\n{{- end }}\r\n=== end ===\r\n\r\nA model reads ONE text. Before every reply, Ollama fills this template with the messages:\r\nthe app's note (role \"system\") and your question (role \"user\") end up side by side in that text.\r\n\r\nLines of this template that place the system note:\r\n   {{- if or (eq .Role \"user\") (eq .Role \"system\") }}<start_of_turn>user\r\n"]
